WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:02.060
- [Woman] Riku, let go of his tail.

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.152
I'm sorry Kwame.

00:00:03.152 --> 00:00:05.569
(jazz music)

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.000
- They look so cute and loving.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.960
And I don't have any pets so I'm like,

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.970
give me a fur baby.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.210
- Beanie babies, who?

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.300
Like, get rid of them.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.040
- I don't think I ever had a Furby, but

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.029
I remember just really
wanting one and really like

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:26.928
envying my friends who had them.

00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:29.877
- I was just so in love
with them and they were $70

00:00:29.877 --> 00:00:32.858
and we just couldn't afford a $70 Furby.

00:00:32.858 --> 00:00:34.990
- Oh my God, I'm excited!

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.490
- Oh wow, oh wow, look
at this sweet little box.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.039
That is not how they feel.

00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:42.550
(laughter)

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.820
- Oh my God is this
how soft it's gonna be?

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.670
- Look at it's eyes, oh
my God, it's so cute.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:49.989
- This isn't nearly as
creepy as I remember.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:54.018
- Oh, it's so tender, his little feet.

00:00:54.018 --> 00:00:56.274
Look at his little nugget feet.

00:00:56.274 --> 00:00:58.410
- This is always the
part that I don't know.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.856
Do we have to screw it back in just yet?

00:00:59.856 --> 00:01:02.023
(screams)

00:01:03.787 --> 00:01:07.410
- Oh, uh oh, this now feels

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.196
like I'm doing something very bad.

00:01:09.196 --> 00:01:11.454
(Furby babbling)

00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:13.710
- This is actually kind of annoying.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.485
So okay, I'm, hold on just one second.

00:01:16.485 --> 00:01:20.736
I'm just gonna do one
quick thing, cool, okay.

00:01:20.736 --> 00:01:22.711
(Furby babbling)

00:01:22.711 --> 00:01:26.790
- Oh, my Furby's drunk.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.730
- Hello, what is it, Quill?

00:01:30.385 --> 00:01:31.666
- So now he can't (mumbles).

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.174
(laughter)

00:01:33.174 --> 00:01:34.387
- Wake up!

00:01:34.387 --> 00:01:38.177
So my Furby's broken,
I'm very disappointed.

00:01:38.177 --> 00:01:40.469
So we're gonna get a new one.

00:01:40.469 --> 00:01:42.969
(piano music)

00:01:46.235 --> 00:01:47.068
- What?

00:01:53.477 --> 00:01:54.310
- No way!

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.293
What the (beep)?

00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:02.520
- Alright so me and my
Furby are hangin out.

00:02:03.818 --> 00:02:06.073
He will not stop talking.

00:02:06.073 --> 00:02:08.480
Let's introduce some people to my Furby.

00:02:09.932 --> 00:02:11.335
- Can you make it curse?

00:02:11.335 --> 00:02:12.850
- [Woman] I don't know,
this is what it says,

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.990
this is it's language, it speaks Furbish.

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:16.336
Try saying something to it.

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:17.440
- [Furby] Stretch?

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.900
(beep)

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.210
- So I just turned my Furby on at home

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.015
and my dog immediately got up to look

00:02:24.015 --> 00:02:26.350
for what the hell was going on.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:27.770
My Furby actually fell asleep.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.180
Furby, Furby!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.210
Do your thing, girl,
everyone else in this house

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.260
does their own thing.

00:02:34.094 --> 00:02:35.744
- Wheatie!

00:02:35.744 --> 00:02:37.120
Boo!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:40.000
Boo, it's not even listening to me.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.267
Oh, when you pull his tail he farts.

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:43.860
- Every night I come home to get ready

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.940
for the next day, I look at it and

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.400
I prepare for the gym.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:52.709
And this little guy, this
little Satan thing over here.

00:02:52.709 --> 00:02:54.930
Like I wish that he would
wait to be spoken to,

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:57.780
like I wish, he's like that
friend that interrupts--

00:02:59.288 --> 00:03:01.747
- So today is bring your
Furby to work day for me.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:04.414
(Furby singing)

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:06.930
Kwame won't shut up.

00:03:08.042 --> 00:03:09.670
(speaking foreign language)

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:10.940
- [Producer] did you ever have a Furby?

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.106
- No, I never had a
Furby but this is creepy.

00:03:13.106 --> 00:03:14.668
No, no, no.

00:03:14.668 --> 00:03:18.418
(Furby moaning and laughing)

00:03:24.111 --> 00:03:25.928
- He has actual eyes.

00:03:25.928 --> 00:03:27.259
- I know.

00:03:27.259 --> 00:03:29.854
- Look at it's (beep)ing eyes.

00:03:29.854 --> 00:03:32.382
- [Selorm] Maybe he'll
bring yours back to life.

00:03:32.382 --> 00:03:34.521
- Wait, this is so annoying.

00:03:34.521 --> 00:03:38.550
I'm happy that I don't need to
be taking care of this thing.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:41.250
- I actually had Furby in my gym bag,

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.535
and, he went the fuck off.

00:03:44.535 --> 00:03:48.450
I think the mask fell off in the bag.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.541
So he woke up.

00:03:49.541 --> 00:03:52.700
And he's been talking,
for the past 44 minutes.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:55.062
- [Selorm] My dog and Furby
are not getting along.

00:03:55.062 --> 00:03:57.690
He was just biting Furby.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.202
Oh my God, Riku!

00:03:59.202 --> 00:04:01.590
Aw shit, Kwame, Kwame.

00:04:03.221 --> 00:04:05.400
- [Kwame] Oh, there you are.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.910
- We're all friends now.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.979
- Y'all, it has been four
days with this thing.

00:04:13.979 --> 00:04:16.646
(Furby babbles)

00:04:19.633 --> 00:04:21.201
- [Furby] Challenge accepted!

00:04:21.201 --> 00:04:22.608
- I'm feeding him right now.

00:04:22.608 --> 00:04:23.760
Uh oh, he fell asleep.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:25.623
Same.

00:04:25.623 --> 00:04:27.925
- It's been fun, I've
learned a lot with the Furby.

00:04:27.925 --> 00:04:32.022
When I was a kid, I really
wanted this toy, and...

00:04:32.022 --> 00:04:33.780
Can you, can you stop?

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:37.090
But now I realized that I
don't really need a Furby

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.170
in my life and I'm very good without one.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.605
- Super annoying, but I do love him.

00:04:41.605 --> 00:04:44.610
I'm gonna give him to
my little, like, nephew

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.804
so we'll see how it goes.

00:04:45.804 --> 00:04:48.471
(Furby snoring)

00:04:49.778 --> 00:04:51.712
- Whoa, my God, it's over.

00:04:51.712 --> 00:04:54.212
(jazzy music)

